# Firebase iOS config. Public values (same class as the VITE_FIREBASE_* web
# config) but kept out of git to match them; deploy-ios.yml writes it from
# the IOS_GOOGLE_SERVICE_INFO_PLIST_BASE64 secret, and the Xcode project
# references it, so a missing file is a build error rather than a launch
# crash. Locally: download it from Firebase Console → Project settings →
# Your apps → iOS and drop it here.
App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist
